# Next-level roadmap: every change that moves this paper to the top

**Paper**: "Herd Immunity and Learning Externalities in Markets of Adaptive
Models" (EconML @ NeurIPS 2026, Atlanta). Written 25 Aug 2026, four days
before the 29 Aug AoE deadline.

One honest caveat before the list: nothing guarantees the top of a review
stack, because review has noise no author controls. What a paper *can*
control is leaving the reviewer nothing to hold against it and giving them
one thing they cannot forget. Every item below serves one of those two
goals, ordered by when it can land and how much it moves the needle. The
external v1 review scored the paper ~70% (accept as poster) and named what
would move it to high 80s; Tier 1 contains exactly that, plus what my own
verification found.

